Package: box
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Jegly <jjjegly@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= @PYMIN@), python3 (<< @PYMAX@),
 python3-gi,
 gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.0),
 gir1.2-adw-1,
 gir1.2-gstreamer-1.0,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-good,
 gstreamer1.0-pipewire,
 libportaudio2,
 libgomp1,
 libssl3t64 | libssl3,
 zlib1g,
 libzstd1
Recommends: libvulkan1
Description: Box — on-device AI workbench (GTK4)
 Native GTK4/libadwaita desktop app that runs LiteRT-LM and GGUF
 (llama.cpp) models fully locally — chat with text/images/audio, the
 Box Code coding agent, image generation/inpaint/upscale, document Q&A,
 voice conversation, live camera vision, and web/file tools. Inference
 runs kernel-sandboxed. No account, no telemetry.
 .
 Closed-source binary build: the application code ships compiled to a
 native extension. Chat models are downloaded on first use; the
 inference engines and small helper models are bundled.
